Findings
Ordered by priority. Each finding maps to checks in the deterministic engine.
2.1
P0
Restore public access for the audited URL
The homepage returns a 403 response for automated agent user agents.
restore-public-access · effort: medium
2.2
P1
Add a useful /llms.txt entrypoint
A /llms.txt file helps agents discover the machine-readable content layer.
add-llms-txt · effort: small ·
Fix Guide
2.3
P2
