reduce-boilerplate-noise · effort: large
03
Agent layer
Implemented — 4/10, index-ai Level 2b. Agents query typed content nodes through clean endpoints instead of rendering pages.
The agent index declares relations between nodes and measured payload sizes, so agents plan their token budget before fetching. Freshness signals let them skip unchanged content entirely.
